        {
          "supplier": "thm-borel-products-of-euclidean-spaces-are-euclidean-borel",
          "carrier": "items/thm-borel-products-of-euclidean-spaces-are-euclidean-borel.md",
          "status": "current published mathematical supplier; exact interface inspected",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "exact_statement": "Let $m,n \\ge 1$. Under the identification\n$$\\mathbb R^{m+n}=\\mathbb R^m \\times \\mathbb R^n,$$\none has\n$$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^m)\\otimes\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n) = \\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^{m+n}).$$",
          "relevant_hypotheses_and_conventions": "The exact excerpt is quoted above; the consumer Facts and proof step state the hypotheses and conventions used.",
